sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Comerciante
  participant Web as Frontend
  participant API as Express API
  participant Econ as economic-index.service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  U->>Web: Abrir desglose USD / Confirmar
  Web->>API: GET /api/locals/:id/usd-breakdown
  API-->>Web: rubros BCRA + variacion diaria
  U->>Web: Aplicar variacion USD
  Web->>API: PUT /api/locals/:id/apply-usd
  API->>Econ: applyUsdToLocal
  Note over Econ: Solo rubros preferred_index BCRA
  Econ->>DB: update products cost + sale_price
  Econ->>DB: price_history change_reason BCRA_RATE
  Econ->>DB: set last_usd_applied_period
  DB-->>Econ: ok
  Econ-->>API: summary
  API-->>Web: success
  Web-->>U: Banner USD aplicado
